<title>USA: Javelin Systems prices IPO at $5/shr.</title>
<headline>Javelin Systems prices IPO at $5/shr.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Javelin Systems Inc Tuesday priced its initial public offering of 850,000 shares of common stock at $5 per share.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said gross proceeds will be $4.25 million. Following the offering, the company will have approximately 2,954,250 shares of common Stock outstanding.</p>
<p>Javelin Systems designs, develops, market and sells open system, touch-screen, point-of-sale (POS) computers primarily for the food-service industry.</p>
